join Dumi (Neutral) left
join Hope (Neutral) right
update Dumi (Warm)
Dumi: He let it go, then.
- For less than I expected
	Hope: For less than I expected.
	Dumi: He'll have wanted something. Not money — a favour, or to be asked about something else later.
	Dumi: I keep a note. Not to collect — to remember. If he needs something in two years and I've forgotten he did this, that's the whole system broken.
	Dumi: That's what people mean when they say I know everybody. I don't. I just write things down.
